    "text": "<p>Polyester&nbsp;is any of a group of polymers that consist basically the&nbsp;repeated units of an ester. Polyester is a synthetic fabric that&rsquo;s usually derived from petroleum. Dacron, PHBV and Glyptal are polyesters. Novolac is a linear condensation polymer of phenol and formaldehyde.</p>",
